WEBVTT

1
00:00:20.730 --> 00:00:22.200
I can do that?

2
00:00:26.530 --> 00:00:28.580
No. no. I've already been
to hell and back!

3
00:00:28.660 --> 00:00:30.710
I won't let you take this from me.

4
00:00:32.200 --> 00:00:34.580
I won't die!

5
00:00:36.750 --> 00:00:38.500
Huh?

6
00:00:38.580 --> 00:00:42.550
Did increasing my strength stat
make that much of a difference?

7
00:00:44.040 --> 00:00:46.930
Doesn't matter.
it's still got me outclassed.

8
00:00:50.470 --> 00:00:52.390
My attacks aren't working!

9
00:00:59.940 --> 00:01:02.150
How am I supposed to win?

10
00:02:42.080 --> 00:02:43.710
I can't do this alone.

11
00:02:47.340 --> 00:02:49.300
No party. no healer.

12
00:02:49.380 --> 00:02:51.510
I only packed water and food.

13
00:02:53.300 --> 00:02:54.720
I'm screwed.

14
00:02:55.680 --> 00:02:58.110
I should've brought some
kind of magic weapon!

15
00:02:58.760 --> 00:03:01.400
Wait! Open inventory!

16
00:03:16.870 --> 00:03:19.420
How'd Mister Kim's sword
even get in there?

17
00:03:21.200 --> 00:03:24.500
I remember him saying
he paid 3 million for it.

18
00:03:24.580 --> 00:03:26.930
Way outside my budget.
that's for sure.

19
00:03:27.920 --> 00:03:30.470
But since I have it. I should use it.

20
00:03:31.130 --> 00:03:33.470
Huh? Hey. the pain's fading.

21
00:03:36.220 --> 00:03:39.730
Now that I'm armed. you're not scary!

22
00:03:43.010 --> 00:03:45.410
What? It's stuck!

23
00:03:47.150 --> 00:03:49.610
Come on! Come out!

24
00:03:51.270 --> 00:03:52.490
Ah!

25
00:03:58.280 --> 00:04:01.080
Guess you're called
"steel-fanged" for a reason.

26
00:04:01.160 --> 00:04:03.790
But I just got this sword so!

27
00:04:04.880 --> 00:04:07.380
Chew on something else!

28
00:04:13.080 --> 00:04:14.850
I've gotta admit.

29
00:04:14.930 --> 00:04:17.350
Compared to those behemoths.

30
00:04:17.430 --> 00:04:19.270
you mutts are nothing.

31
00:04:34.730 --> 00:04:36.160
Hmm?

32
00:04:36.240 --> 00:04:38.990
Whoa. I'm at level two.

33
00:04:39.070 --> 00:04:41.830
Completing daily quests
never changed that.

34
00:04:42.450 --> 00:04:47.040
Guess it's triggered by real combat which
explains why my wounds suddenly healed.

35
00:04:47.120 --> 00:04:52.040
And the bonus for leveling up is all my
stats go up by one. which is cool. I guess?

36
00:04:52.120 --> 00:04:56.760
If I get five points each time.
and daily quests only net me three.

37
00:04:56.840 --> 00:04:59.510
fighting definitely seems
like the way to go.

38
00:04:59.590 --> 00:05:02.930
I wonder if one point really makes
a noticeable difference in power.

39
00:05:03.010 --> 00:05:06.480
'Cause there are values for
perception and intelligence. too.

40
00:05:06.560 --> 00:05:09.020
But strength's the easiest to gauge.

41
00:05:09.100 --> 00:05:13.690
My body feels much lighter than before.
and that's with just 32 points.

42
00:05:13.770 --> 00:05:15.320
Based on what I've learned.

43
00:05:15.400 --> 00:05:17.950
I'm willing to bet that I have
unlimited potential now.

44
00:05:18.030 --> 00:05:20.700
My level and abilities
will just keep going up.

45
00:05:22.400 --> 00:05:25.630
If that's true.
then I can get stronger.

46
00:05:28.500 --> 00:05:33.510
Well. I've only killed five magic beasts.
so maybe I'm getting ahead of myself.

47
00:05:34.970 --> 00:05:36.220
Let me see here.

48
00:05:36.300 --> 00:05:38.390
Did you drop any essence stones?

49
00:05:39.760 --> 00:05:43.970
Huh? Oh. okay. guess I get
fangs and stuff instead.

50
00:05:44.590 --> 00:05:47.230
This strange system I'm caught up in.

51
00:05:47.310 --> 00:05:51.520
Its rules follow game logic
as opposed to real world logic.

52
00:05:51.600 --> 00:05:56.240
So. the beasts in this dungeon will be
different from the ones inside the gates.

53
00:05:56.940 --> 00:06:00.450
Oh. I have access to a shop.
Can I buy?

54
00:06:01.440 --> 00:06:05.840
Beginners are locked out.
Figures. I'll sell. then.

55
00:06:10.540 --> 00:06:12.000
Twenty gold?

56
00:06:12.950 --> 00:06:16.380
And no way of telling how much
that's actually worth.

57
00:06:16.460 --> 00:06:19.300
Considering I still have a pulse.
I think it's an E-Rank dungeon.

58
00:06:19.380 --> 00:06:22.310
so 20's probably
not all that much. really.

59
00:06:23.340 --> 00:06:25.980
Okay. what's next?

60
00:06:26.810 --> 00:06:29.520
To get outta this place.
I gotta defeat the boss.

61
00:06:29.600 --> 00:06:32.310
Teleporting is out
since I don't have any stones.

62
00:06:32.390 --> 00:06:35.070
And I can't waste time
looking for them either.

63
00:06:35.150 --> 00:06:37.410
I don't have enough food
to stay that long.

64
00:06:41.320 --> 00:06:45.870
E-Rank dungeon or not. I don't think
I can beat a boss all on my own.

65
00:06:45.950 --> 00:06:49.420
But maybe my chances would be
better if I leveled up.

66
00:06:51.790 --> 00:06:55.680
I'm sure they would. though I
could easily die in the process.

67
00:07:08.140 --> 00:07:10.390
I shouldn't be afraid.

68
00:07:10.470 --> 00:07:13.020
After all. I've already died once!

69
00:07:29.620 --> 00:07:31.750
I am not going down easy.

70
00:07:32.780 --> 00:07:35.230
And I expect a good fight
from you. too.

71
00:07:36.410 --> 00:07:41.340
'Cause. if I kill you too fast.
I just know that I'm gonna feel bad.

72
00:07:43.210 --> 00:07:45.730
You're qualified to be
a hunter. Mister Sung.

73
00:07:47.050 --> 00:07:49.390
Now we can pay for mom's treatment!

74
00:07:49.470 --> 00:07:52.350
I wish I had another chance.

75
00:07:54.530 --> 00:07:56.360
Let's go.

76
00:07:56.440 --> 00:07:58.530
Come at me with all you've got!

77
00:08:03.770 --> 00:08:07.120
Fight as hard as we can.
till the very end!

78
00:08:08.240 --> 00:08:10.450
If it means I'll get stronger.

79
00:08:10.530 --> 00:08:14.830
I'll follow these rules. no
matter how ridiculous they are!

80
00:08:23.710 --> 00:08:25.430
-Oh!
-Man. that can't be good.

81
00:08:25.510 --> 00:08:28.270
The Association needs
to fix this. stat.

82
00:08:39.060 --> 00:08:42.320
This blade is pretty much spent.

83
00:08:42.400 --> 00:08:45.700
At the end of the day.
every weapon is disposable.

84
00:08:45.780 --> 00:08:50.780
Even the ones with outrageous price tags
are ruined after a handful of dungeon runs.

85
00:08:50.860 --> 00:08:54.340
but I know this sword
is why I'm still here.

86
00:09:00.000 --> 00:09:05.970
That battle scored me 34 wolf fangs.
two worn daggers. a traveler's cloak.

87
00:09:06.050 --> 00:09:11.310
And look at that. a safe escape
via my shiny. new teleportation stone.

88
00:09:12.430 --> 00:09:14.600
Should I call it and leave?

89
00:09:14.680 --> 00:09:15.940
Mm.

90
00:09:16.020 --> 00:09:20.310
What if I never get the chance
to level up this easily again?

91
00:09:20.390 --> 00:09:24.820
This dungeon might vanish the instant
I teleport out of here. I don't know.

92
00:09:25.700 --> 00:09:28.820
Maybe it's like a limited-time event.

93
00:09:28.900 --> 00:09:31.700
which makes the disappearing
thing all the more likely.

94
00:09:32.650 --> 00:09:37.210
Ultimately. I'm being played
by someone or something.

95
00:09:38.190 --> 00:09:41.190
On the Buddha's palm.
doing my little dance.

96
00:09:43.790 --> 00:09:46.850
Do I keep going forward.
or head back?

97
00:10:02.490 --> 00:10:05.160
Yes? Joohee Lee speaking.

98
00:10:05.240 --> 00:10:07.660
Oh. Of course. I remember. sir.

99
00:10:07.740 --> 00:10:10.240
I'm sorry I turned you down
the other day.

100
00:10:11.400 --> 00:10:12.570
Huh?

101
00:10:12.650 --> 00:10:15.290
There was a dungeon break
at that gate?

102
00:10:15.370 --> 00:10:17.620
That's not too far!

103
00:10:17.700 --> 00:10:20.250
If I'd accepted his offer...

104
00:10:20.330 --> 00:10:23.040
We've been reaching out to
every available hunter we can.

105
00:10:23.120 --> 00:10:26.680
but there's a major shortage
of healers. Miss Lee.

106
00:10:32.210 --> 00:10:33.720
I'll be right there.

107
00:10:34.800 --> 00:10:40.730
Each time my level goes up. killing
magic beasts gets a little easier for me.

108
00:10:49.820 --> 00:10:52.320
Their labels changed colors. too.

109
00:10:52.400 --> 00:10:55.030
I think white means
they're relatively weak.

110
00:10:55.110 --> 00:10:59.960
Orange is about equal to me.
and red. red means trouble.

111
00:11:00.580 --> 00:11:03.040
The Lycans were red
when I first fought them.

112
00:11:03.120 --> 00:11:04.880
Now. they're all white.

113
00:11:05.670 --> 00:11:07.920
That's just how much
stronger I've gotten.

114
00:11:08.000 --> 00:11:13.510
And yet. I'm still hesitant to take
on whatever's waiting down there.

115
00:11:14.250 --> 00:11:17.230
My perception stat
got a significant boost.

116
00:11:17.310 --> 00:11:18.810
so I can sense it.

117
00:11:19.810 --> 00:11:22.560
There's something powerful
beneath me.

118
00:11:22.640 --> 00:11:24.440
and it's giving me chills.

119
00:11:26.190 --> 00:11:29.400
I doubt I can level up any more here.

120
00:11:29.480 --> 00:11:32.490
And this sword's a few swipes
away from breaking.

121
00:11:44.660 --> 00:11:48.510
Is it just me. or does this thing
have more steps than it used to?

122
00:12:02.600 --> 00:12:05.230
How is this place Hapjeong Station?

123
00:12:09.940 --> 00:12:11.040
Huh?

124
00:12:11.720 --> 00:12:13.120
It's fast!

125
00:12:17.370 --> 00:12:18.870
The sword!

126
00:12:24.200 --> 00:12:25.420
What color's the name?

127
00:12:25.500 --> 00:12:28.230
C'mon. please. be white.
Please. be white. Please. be white.

128
00:12:28.310 --> 00:12:31.710
I leveled up fourteen times.
so surely you have to be...

129
00:12:31.790 --> 00:12:32.710
Crap.

130
00:12:32.790 --> 00:12:36.140
"King of the Swamp" and boss
of the dungeon. yeah?

131
00:12:36.220 --> 00:12:39.760
Even before it broke. no way this
sword could pierce those scales.

132
00:12:39.840 --> 00:12:42.020
And fist fighting's definitely out.

133
00:12:52.350 --> 00:12:54.940
Between its speed and how
it throws its weight around.

134
00:12:55.020 --> 00:12:57.240
getting through its defense
is gonna be tricky!

135
00:12:57.320 --> 00:13:00.210
I mean. what can I do
against armor this thick?

136
00:13:08.540 --> 00:13:11.050
One clean hit on me. and I'm dead.

137
00:13:31.810 --> 00:13:34.440
The little strength I
gained was huge for me.

138
00:13:43.450 --> 00:13:46.920
But it. it's still not enough.

139
00:13:47.960 --> 00:13:51.130
How much stronger do I need to get

140
00:13:51.210 --> 00:13:56.680
before I'm finally able to escape
my past as a laughing stock?

141
00:14:00.380 --> 00:14:02.840
"The Weakest Hunter of All Mankind?"

142
00:14:02.920 --> 00:14:05.440
Yeah. I hear that's what
they've been calling you.

143
00:14:05.520 --> 00:14:06.770
Oh. I see.

144
00:14:06.850 --> 00:14:10.940
They're adults. yet they act like
such childish jerks sometimes.

145
00:14:11.560 --> 00:14:14.730
Work hard and prove them
all wrong. I know you can.

146
00:14:16.110 --> 00:14:19.740
Right. I will.
Thanks. Mister Song.

147
00:14:37.090 --> 00:14:40.050
I'm weak. so I get a crappy nickname.

148
00:14:40.130 --> 00:14:42.810
I'm weak. so no one believes in me.

149
00:14:45.640 --> 00:14:48.020
I hate how worthless I am.

150
00:14:49.020 --> 00:14:51.020
I want strength!

151
00:14:52.140 --> 00:14:55.530
Overwhelming power
brings people to their knees.

152
00:14:55.610 --> 00:14:58.860
The strong go into every
situation with an advantage.

153
00:14:58.940 --> 00:15:02.780
while the weak quiver in fear
or stand around helplessly.

154
00:15:02.860 --> 00:15:04.990
The weak get looked down on.

155
00:15:05.070 --> 00:15:08.000
Doesn't matter how smart.
creative. or kind they are!

156
00:15:08.080 --> 00:15:10.580
The weak always lose!

157
00:15:10.660 --> 00:15:12.750
I always lose.

158
00:15:12.830 --> 00:15:15.550
My kindness never saved me. No.

159
00:15:15.630 --> 00:15:17.670
What I need now is true strength.

160
00:15:17.750 --> 00:15:21.050
And I am not gonna
give up until I get it!

161
00:15:21.130 --> 00:15:23.640
Just watch me!

162
00:15:35.690 --> 00:15:37.370
I swear it.

163
00:15:42.320 --> 00:15:45.160
I'll get stronger
if it's the last thing I do!

164
00:15:51.410 --> 00:15:53.410
I'm not done yet!

165
00:15:53.490 --> 00:15:58.510
Compared to that thing.
compared to the terror I felt that day!

166
00:15:58.590 --> 00:16:00.430
This is nothing!

167
00:16:05.890 --> 00:16:07.310
Ah!

168
00:16:15.140 --> 00:16:18.360
I put all of my
ability points into strength!

169
00:16:23.310 --> 00:16:25.570
With the power I have...

170
00:16:29.280 --> 00:16:31.290
With the power I have...

171
00:16:32.570 --> 00:16:35.540
I know I can kill you
right here and now!

172
00:16:37.710 --> 00:16:42.630
So die!

173
00:17:12.530 --> 00:17:14.580
Even if it's just a bit.

174
00:17:14.660 --> 00:17:17.550
"The Weakest Hunter
of all Mankind" got stronger.

175
00:17:25.880 --> 00:17:28.890
Well. at least I bagged a nice prize.

176
00:17:28.970 --> 00:17:33.180
Though I'm kinda shocked it's made
from the snake's fang instead of its bone.

177
00:17:34.430 --> 00:17:37.650
It has double the attack power
of Mister Kim's sword.

178
00:17:37.730 --> 00:17:40.150
plus. paralysis and drain effects!

179
00:17:40.230 --> 00:17:41.990
And what do we have here?

180
00:17:42.690 --> 00:17:46.000
Seems too scary to use.
but I'll still hang on to it.

181
00:17:48.200 --> 00:17:49.500
Huh?

182
00:17:55.280 --> 00:17:57.170
I beat the dungeon.

183
00:18:08.130 --> 00:18:11.140
It's like a ghost town.
What time is it?

184
00:18:11.220 --> 00:18:14.470
Hey. you!
No civilians beyond this point.

185
00:18:14.550 --> 00:18:16.400
Did you not listen to the broadcast?

186
00:18:16.480 --> 00:18:17.850
What broadcast?

187
00:18:17.930 --> 00:18:19.650
Look. kid. This isn't a joke.

188
00:18:19.730 --> 00:18:22.900
Huh? Wait. Are you a hunter?

189
00:18:22.980 --> 00:18:24.850
Yes. sir. That's correct.

190
00:18:24.930 --> 00:18:26.450
I apologize for the confusion.

191
00:18:26.530 --> 00:18:28.950
Allow me to escort you.
Right this way.

192
00:18:29.030 --> 00:18:30.910
Oh. okay.

193
00:18:30.990 --> 00:18:33.410
Sounds like something bad happened.

194
00:18:37.870 --> 00:18:39.620
Of course. a dungeon break.

195
00:18:39.700 --> 00:18:42.250
How many magic beasts
are still wreaking havoc. sir?

196
00:18:42.330 --> 00:18:45.040
Most have been dealt with
since it's nearing the end.

197
00:18:45.120 --> 00:18:48.010
Only one left now.
and it's a big one.

198
00:18:48.090 --> 00:18:50.510
My enhanced perception
told me as much.

199
00:18:50.590 --> 00:18:54.810
It's over there.
The boss is alive and kicking.

200
00:19:00.680 --> 00:19:01.980
No pictures. please!

201
00:19:02.060 --> 00:19:04.230
You should be evacuating!

202
00:19:05.820 --> 00:19:07.580
How much longer will this take?

203
00:19:07.660 --> 00:19:10.610
What if the fight continues to
escalate and gets even worse?

204
00:19:10.690 --> 00:19:11.950
Come on. healers!

205
00:19:12.030 --> 00:19:14.400
Focus all of your energy
on supporting the tank!

206
00:19:14.480 --> 00:19:16.840
That's what we're doing!
Can't you tell?

207
00:19:18.330 --> 00:19:21.540
Are none of you damage
dealers taking this seriously?

208
00:19:21.620 --> 00:19:24.080
I don't think you've put
a single crack in this rock!

209
00:19:24.160 --> 00:19:27.050
Its defense is insane at
least against physical attacks.

210
00:19:27.130 --> 00:19:29.380
and we're short on mages.
so what can we do?

211
00:19:29.460 --> 00:19:31.300
Make way! Hunter coming through!

212
00:19:31.380 --> 00:19:35.010
This crew looks thrown-together
last-minute. Very out of sync.

213
00:19:36.560 --> 00:19:38.640
Low ranks. too.

214
00:19:38.720 --> 00:19:42.600
I see eight E-Rank hunters and two D.

215
00:19:42.680 --> 00:19:45.740
One of the D's is a tank. which
is why this battle has dragged on

216
00:19:45.820 --> 00:19:48.070
longer than it should.

217
00:19:48.150 --> 00:19:51.900
As for healers.
we've got two D and a B.

218
00:19:51.980 --> 00:19:53.740
Hey. you gonna help or not?

219
00:19:53.820 --> 00:19:57.950
You're the highest ranked healer we have.
and we clearly need some support magic!

220
00:19:58.030 --> 00:19:59.660
Don't just stand there. lady!

221
00:19:59.740 --> 00:20:01.500
Right! I'm sorry!

222
00:20:03.240 --> 00:20:05.880
Stay alert and you won't have to be!

223
00:20:11.090 --> 00:20:15.300
One week later. and she's
still shaken up about it.

224
00:20:15.380 --> 00:20:17.560
Can't blame her. though.

225
00:20:17.640 --> 00:20:19.100
I am. too.

226
00:20:20.140 --> 00:20:21.440
No.

227
00:20:24.010 --> 00:20:26.230
It's a D-Rank boss.

228
00:20:26.310 --> 00:20:29.360
And I just tore through
a much tougher beast's throat!

229
00:20:30.730 --> 00:20:32.440
We'll be wiped out at this rate!

230
00:20:32.520 --> 00:20:35.320
Why'd no one recruit
higher-ranked hunters for this?

231
00:20:35.400 --> 00:20:38.330
If I breach its defenses. that's it.

232
00:20:38.410 --> 00:20:39.790
They win!

233
00:20:43.870 --> 00:20:46.960
Can I pierce it with one strike?

234
00:20:47.040 --> 00:20:48.680
Let's see!

235
00:20:50.670 --> 00:20:52.500
Look! Its barrier's down!

236
00:20:52.580 --> 00:20:54.010
Now's our chance!

237
00:21:02.550 --> 00:21:05.390
You guys. we actually did it!

238
00:21:06.100 --> 00:21:10.520
Our attacks barely scratched it. then
suddenly its shield was obliterated.

239
00:21:10.600 --> 00:21:14.730
No one goes from doing zero to a
hundred damage. so it wasn't us.

240
00:21:14.810 --> 00:21:16.660
Who or what was it?

241
00:21:18.700 --> 00:21:20.780
A boss-level golem
that withstood the attacks

242
00:21:20.860 --> 00:21:26.040
of over ten hunters. completely unfazed.
got done in by a piece of junk?

243
00:21:26.960 --> 00:21:29.040
-Excuse me. sir.
-Yes.

244
00:21:29.120 --> 00:21:31.790
Did you happen to see
who threw that broken sword?

245
00:21:31.870 --> 00:21:35.550
Yeah. it was that
straggler hunter there. Wait...

246
00:21:36.180 --> 00:21:38.230
What incredible power.

247
00:21:39.340 --> 00:21:41.430
How high is that guy ranked?

248
00:21:48.980 --> 00:21:51.400
I didn't think a single attack
would work.

249
